# ROVEXO MASTER ENGINE — GOLDEN RULE (LOCK)

**NO FEATURE MAY BE IMPLEMENTED OUTSIDE THE MASTER ENGINE.**

## Correct APIs (only)

```ts
import {
  resolveFeatureVisibility,
  resolveVerifiedStatus,
  resolveBusinessVisibility,
  resolveStoreShowcaseVisibility,
  registerSmartFeature,
  registerStoreShowcase,
} from "@/lib/master-engine";

resolveFeatureVisibility("holiday-mode", user);
resolveVerifiedStatus(user);
resolveBusinessVisibility(user);
resolveStoreShowcaseVisibility(user);
```

## Forbidden

```ts
// WRONG
if (user.hasListings) showHolidayMode();
if (user.isVerified) showVerifiedBadge();
showBusinessBank();
if (user.hasListings >= 2) showStoreShowcase();
```

## Required for every new feature

1. `registerSmartFeature({ id, label, isAvailableInProduction })` (or `registerStoreShowcase()`)
2. Resolve via Master Engine APIs only
3. Never inline production predicates in UI / menus / pages

## Modes

Local / QA / Demo / Certification / Visual / E2E → SHOW EVERYTHING  
Production only after Owner `activateProductionRules()`  

Nothing deleted — only show / hide / enable / disable / block.
